= A study of river sediments
#block(width: 20cm)[Microplastic particles were found in every one of the eighteen samples taken along the river from the headwater forest to the estuary.]
#block(width: 30cm)[Sediments integrate pollution over months to years, so they reveal contamination that water samples can miss along the whole river.]
